WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.800
Hi, this is Serenia: a hand-made media player.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.600
These captions come from a WebVTT file,
the Spanish ones come from an .srt file.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.500
Open the effects panel with the E key
or the settings button.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.500
Hover the progress bar
to see a thumbnail of that frame.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.500
Press S to save the current frame as PNG.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.500
And press ? to see every keyboard shortcut.
